      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="유스케이스 명세서" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;dashed=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="260" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="기능: AI 챗봇 질의응답" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;dashed=0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="20" width="520" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="유스케이스 ID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="220" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="UC-AI-02" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="90" width="1200" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="유스케이스명" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="160" width="220" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="AI 챗봇 질의응답" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="160" width="1200" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="주 액터" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="220" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="방문자" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="230" width="1200" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="보조 액터" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="220" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="ChatPage, ChatController, ChatService, BoothService, EventService, LostItemService, NoticeService, AiCongestionService, OpenAI API" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="300" width="1200" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="트리거" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="220" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="방문자가 챗봇 화면에서 질문을 입력하고 전송한다." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="370" width="1200" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="사전조건" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="220" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="1. 사용자가 챗봇 화면에 접근할 수 있다.
2. 축제 데이터가 시스템에 적재되어 있다." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="440" width="1200" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="사후조건" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="542" width="220" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="1. 답변, 근거, 신뢰도, 경고 메시지가 반환된다.
2. 화면에 답변 카드와 근거 카드가 표시된다." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="542" width="1200" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="기본 흐름" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="654" width="220" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="41" value="1. 방문자가 질문을 입력한다.
2. ChatPage가 /api/chat으로 질문을 전송한다.
3. ChatController가 ChatService.answer(question)를 호출한다.
4. ChatService가 질문 의도를 분석하고 관련 근거를 검색한다.
5. 부스, 공연, 분실물, 공지, AI 추천 근거를 조합한다.
6. OpenAI API가 사용 가능하면 근거 포함 프롬프트로 답변을 생성한다.
7. ChatService가 답변, 신뢰도, 경고, 근거 목록을 조립한다.
8. ChatPage가 답변 카드와 근거 카드를 표시한다." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="654" width="1200" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="42" value="대안 흐름" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="854" width="220" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="43" value="A1. OpenAI API 키가 없으면 retrieval 결과를 바탕으로 fallback 답변을 생성한다.
A2. OpenAI 호출 실패 시 기본 안내와 경고 메시지를 함께 반환한다.
A3. 근거가 없으면 불확실성을 알리고 더 구체적인 재질문을 유도한다." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d79b00;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="854" width="1200" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="44" value="비즈니스 규칙" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="984" width="220" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="45" value="1. 답변은 Evidence 목록에 근거한 사실만 사용한다.
2. 최대 5개의 근거를 제공한다.
3. 근거 수와 경고 여부에 따라 HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW 신뢰도를 부여한다." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="984" width="1200" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
